{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try 2 Sleep is a short, focused co-op horror experience designed to be played in a single sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner have just moved into a new house, only to realize that something is deeply wrong. During a chaotic and dangerous night, your worst nightmares begin to take shape, and true rest becomes impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.poster.avif?t=1771162701\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.webm?t=1771162701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/437fb0f508d07ddb0dc8f9108fd9902b.mp4?t=1771162701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How well do you work together? Survival depends on constant communication and perfect coordination. One mistake can be enough to end everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.poster.avif?t=1771162701\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.webm?t=1771162701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/90ebc419c17a5f2b4b6e0d4e4605a867.mp4?t=1771162701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleeping allows you to recover energy, but it also pushes the night forward, making the house increasingly dangerous. You must decide when to take risks, find the key to escape, and uncover what lies beyond the garden gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.poster.avif?t=1771162701\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.webm?t=1771162701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238310/extras/c53583368bffa241e8e5b32b340faabc.mp4?t=1771162701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends using Steam Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play is available, but survival will be far more dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil artificial intelligence controls the house, making each night a different experience.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pillow Fight!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/4a2f50a0c23e6d6e0d20a2144431e415f75e76d1.jpg"},{"name":"Midnight Kiss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/06c8fac00eb331d7d8f417c00f9264dd265c2bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/c6c74b6c47323407fc76556fc1c6636a4b0a2897.jpg"},{"name":"Pumpkin Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3238310/7cc9551d627d0dc9251d68e3bb0a558049d3730a.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.